TITLE Kinetic dissolution of Albite at pH 2, 200C, with H2S gas phase

SOLUTION 1
    temp      200
    pH        2.0
    Fe(+3)    4.0  mmol/kgw
    Fe(+2)    4.0  mmol/kgw
    -water    1.0  # kg

KINETICS 1
Albite
    -m0   1.0
    -m    1.0
    -parms 1.0  10.0
    -step  1000 in 100

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5.0
    -volume   1.0
    -temp     200
    H2S(g)    5.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     albite_kinetic.sel
    -reset    false
    -step
    -totals   Ba

END
